  // ================= CAPACITY-HONESTY (X-R7-1 V2 replay) =================
  // H-ROUTER8 R8-4: replays the red team's X-R7-1 exploratory V2 fixture
  // verbatim (the 40-mark merge-resistant curriculum that defeated the R7
